WEBVTT

00:08:58.117 --> 00:09:00.578
and they will go to jail immediately.

00:09:03.497 --> 00:09:05.082
Whose eye is this?

00:09:05.624 --> 00:09:06.834
Someone you love?

00:09:06.875 --> 00:09:08.252
Someone you hate?

00:09:08.711 --> 00:09:13.132
It belongs to a man who was prepared
to go to jail for his beliefs.

00:09:13.674 --> 00:09:16.802
The late, great Muhammad Ali.

00:09:17.928 --> 00:09:22.391
I said to him, "Muhammad,
you are the greatest.

00:09:22.933 --> 00:09:24.602
Teach me to be great.

00:09:24.643 --> 00:09:26.729
How can my generation be as great

00:09:26.729 --> 00:09:30.190
as your generation had to be
during the civil rights era?"